OL,3,GNEWSAPort will play huge role in       
OL,4,Afuture, says minister                  
OL,6,FEnergy Minister Michael Shanks has said
OL,7,Fnew windfarms which are about to be    
OL,8,Fbuilt off England's east coast will    
OL,9,Fbring new jobs and economic            
OL,10,Fopportunities to Lowestoft.            
OL,12,FHe said the Suffolk town that had been 
OL,13,Fso important to Britain's past would   
OL,14,Fonce again play a "huge role" in the   
OL,15,Fcountry's economic future.             
OL,17,FThe minister was speaking during a     
OL,18,Fvisit to the town's port to see        
OL,19,Fpreparatory work for the new Vanguard  
OL,20,FEast and West windfarms.               
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
