OL,3,GNEWSAPort will play huge role in       
OL,4,Afuture, says minister                  
OL,6,FThe company says the project will      
OL,7,Fsupport 3,000 jobs, of which the       
OL,8,Fmajority will be in the east of        
OL,9,FEngland.                               
